<title>USA: Guess? Q1 EPS $0.42 vs $0.39 pro forma.</title>
<headline>Guess? Q1 EPS $0.42 vs $0.39 pro forma.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.42		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net			 18,013		   24,047</p>
<p> Revs		     135,736		  134,898</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	42,898		   42,682</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarters ended March 30, 1997, and March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Per share earnings are reported on a pro forma basis in 1996, reflecting certain adjustments regarding taxes and the company's initial public offering.</p>
<p>Excluding a benefit of $0.09 per share in the 1997 quarter as a result of an accounting change, per share earnings in the 1997 and 1996 quarters were $0.33 and $0.39, respectively.</p>
</text>
